  2236	  /// The reject admits +/-2 buckets where +/-1 is provably enough in exact arithmetic. The extra
  2237	  /// bucket is insurance against a floor() landing on the far side of a boundary through rounding,
  2238	  /// which would silently DROP a candidate; it costs a pass rate of ~0.9% instead of ~0.6%.
